/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This study examines how digital touchpoints and in-store experiences jointly shape consumer behaviour in Lenskart. The analysis is based on primary survey data collected from 85 respondents and field observations from different stores: Few in south and few in central Delhi. The purpose is to understand how clarity of information, staff interaction, digital tools and store ambience influence purchase satisfaction and recommendation behaviour.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
